          "Is this gas a plasma?",
          "Three conditions",
          "λ_D << L, ωₚ >> ν_coll, Λ >> 1"
        ],
        [
          "How far does a charge's field penetrate?",
          "Debye length",
          "λ_D = 7430 √(T_e(eV)/n_e(m⁻³)) m"
        ],
        [
          "What frequency do electrons oscillate at?",
          "Plasma frequency",
          "ωₚ = √(ne²/ε₀mₑ); fₚ = 9√n Hz"
        ],
        [
          "What radius does an electron gyrate?",
          "Larmor radius",
          "r_L = mv_⊥/eB"
        ],
        [
          "Why does the ionosphere reflect radio?",
          "Cutoff at ωₚ",
          "EM wave ω < ωₚ → evanescent → reflected"
        ],
        [
          "What speed do MHD waves travel?",
          "Alfvén speed",
          "v_A = B/√(µ₀ρ)"
        ],
        [
          "What fraction of plasma energy is in pressure vs B-field?",
          "Plasma beta",
          "β = nkT/(B²/2µ₀)"
        ],
        [
          "Why are field lines \"frozen\" to plasma?",
          "Flux freezing",
          "Rm >> 1 → induction >> diffusion"
        ],
        [
